{"id":"msg_m_ex_brid_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_brid","label":"Brid · Nikke"},"label":"4. Commander,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_brid_03","next":"msg_m_ex_brid_05","speakers":{"brid":"Brid"},"icons":{"brid":"si_c070_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_1","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_2","text":"I apologize for the interruption.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_3","text":"May I have a moment of your time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_4","text":"It's okay, what's wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_5","text":"A few days ago,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_6","text":"I stopped by your room to deliver some documents.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_7","text":"If I may be so bold,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_8","text":"may I suggest paying closer attention to organizing and maintaining your living space?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_9","text":"It would benefit both your mental and physical health.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_10","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_10","text":"Was it that dirty?","jump":"m_ex_brid_04_12"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_11","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_11","text":"I think it's quite clean.","jump":"m_ex_brid_04_14"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_12","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_13","text":"It's the worst I've ever seen.","jump":"m_ex_brid_04_16"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_14","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_15","text":"I think your standards need adjusting.","jump":"m_ex_brid_04_16"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_16","text":"Working in such substandard conditions","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_17","text":"will undoubtedly hinder your productivity.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_18","text":"No wonder Rapi seems to be having a hard time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_19","text":"How could she not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_20","text":"At the very least,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_21","text":"any and all leftover food","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_22","text":"should be dealt with immediately.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_23","text":"That's Anis's doing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_24","text":"Then, there's the crate of ammunition","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_25","text":"and bullets also carelessly  scattered everywhere.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_26","text":"It'd be bad enough if you were to trip over one of them,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_27","text":"but stepping on them could also potentially cause one to go off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_28","text":"Oh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_29","text":"Not only is it dirty,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_30","text":"but it's dangerous too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_31","text":"You can blame Neon for that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_32","text":"And the recycling is a mess as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_33","text":"I know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_34","text":"The mountain of dirty laundry is practically up to the ceiling.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_35","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_36","text":"And the laundry isn't even separated by color.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_37","text":"What in the world is going on here?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_38","text":"It's your responsibility to maintain order, Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_39","text":"and you're failing miserably.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_40","text":"You're right, it's all my fault T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_41","text":"I guess there's no other choice.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_42","text":"I suppose I can","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_43","text":"spare about 30 minutes tomorrow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_44","text":"What for?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_45","text":"Help you with the cleaning.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_46","text":"Inform Anis and Neon","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_47","text":"that I'll be coming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_48","text":"You don't have to do all that for us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_49","text":"It's not just for you. It's about maintaining my own mental health.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_50","text":"Besides, I'm used to cleaning the AZX,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_51","text":"so don't worry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_04_52","text":"I'll see you tomorrow.","jump":null}],"chat":true}